---
description: >-
  Verifies that a subgraph can override the diagram's default ELK layout
  algorithm for itself using the `@{ algorithm: … }` shape-data syntax, here
  setting the `grp` subgraph to elk.box while the rest of the flowchart uses the
  default elk algorithm.
config:
  layout: elk
---
%% A subgraph opting into its own ELK algorithm via `@{ algorithm: … }`.
flowchart TD
  start[Start] --> grp
  subgraph grp[Grouped]
    a[One]
    b[Two]
    c[Three]
  end
  grp@{ algorithm: elk.box }
  grp --> done[Done]
